{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2023-02-02 07:00:00', 'title': 'MIZUHO BANK MODERNIZES CORE BANKING OPERATIONS WITH ORACLE', 'text': "AFTER A SUCCESSFUL IMPLEMENTATION IN NEW YORK, THE JAPANESE BANKING GIANT CONTINUES ITS PHASED ROLL-OUT OF ORACLE'S BANKING SOLUTIONS TOKYO AND AUSTIN, TEXAS , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MIZUHO BANK, LTD., THE INTEGRATED RETAIL AND CORPORATE BANKING UNIT OF\xa0MIZUHO FINANCIAL GROUP AND ONE OF JAPAN'S LARGEST FINANCIAL SERVICES INSTITUTIONS, IS MODERNIZING ITS LEGACY\xa0BANKING SYSTEM FOR INTERNATIONAL OPERATIONS WITH\xa0ORACLE."}